{
  "title": "The Open Call",
  "hook_type": "warning",
  "cards": [
    {
      "text": "Don't hang up first on a video call.",
      "scene": "table",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1726146469671-07210b70c157?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "rf3Hy_gxXx0",
      "photo_credit": "NHN"
    },
    {
      "text": "I hung up on my wife from the mine camp, but her video stayed open.",
      "scene": "window",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531870095880-cac1a675e830?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "qdexC1ISxmw",
      "photo_credit": "Beer Drinker"
    },
    {
      "text": "She just sat there in our bedroom, smiling at the camera, not blinking.",
      "scene": "house",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1662919247374-531b4fa13e63?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "t958JBIQdAM",
      "photo_credit": "brbrihan__"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, behind her, the bedroom door opened, and my wife walked in.",
      "scene": "door",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1656914871811-148cfdbb6ef4?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "j2SKo92xQWc",
      "photo_credit": "Dorian Stoici"
    },
    {
      "text": "She climbed into bed behind the smiling one, who never turned around.",
      "scene": "hallway",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591077394217-e4e1b63b2046?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "yYp3gVE13G4",
      "photo_credit": "Zane Lee"
    },
    {
      "text": "It leaned close to the screen and whispered, \"She can't hear you.\"",
      "scene": "window",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1648309276440-ffe2885b338d?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "sQSzWV0o4no",
      "photo_credit": "Daniel Leżuch"
    },
    {
      "text": "I ran out to my truck and sat there, shaking, until dawn.",
      "scene": "forest",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1772817337464-3fd35858a089?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "l-FebBrOdaA",
      "photo_credit": "Landon Liedtke"
    },
    {
      "text": "At sunrise, my wife texted, \"Why did you leave your camera on all night?\"",
      "scene": "note",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567136724610-e582484cfa69?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "K7ZUwdcGfeE",
      "photo_credit": "mehdi lamaaffar"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"You just sat there smiling. Not blinking.\"",
      "scene": "dark",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1707581785966-650d2482fa63?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "VWO6lLCjeyk",
      "photo_credit": "Karmishth Tandel"
    }
  ],
